---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  metadata={{
    title: 'Approach | DELVINTA Technologies',
    description:
      'DELVINTA takes a disciplined approach to laboratory integration, from planning and implementation through go-live, stabilization, support, and optimization.',
  }}
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="delvinta-section pt-16 md:pt-24">
    <div class="delvinta-container">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="delvinta-eyebrow">Our Approach</div>

        <h1 class="delvinta-heading mt-6">A disciplined approach to laboratory integration.</h1>

        <p class="delvinta-body mt-7 max-w-2xl">
          DELVINTA brings technical depth, structured execution, and laboratory experience to every stage of the
          integration lifecycle.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LIFECYCLE -->
  <section class="pb-16 md:pb-24">
    <div class="delvinta-container">
      <div class="delvinta-grid rounded-2xl border border-[var(--delvinta-border)] p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-12">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <div class="delvinta-eyebrow">The Lifecycle</div>

          <h2 class="delvinta-heading-small mt-4">From planning to continuous improvement.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[var(--delvinta-border)] bg-white">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4">
            <div class="border-b border-[var(--delvinta-border)] p-5 md:border-r">
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--delvinta-teal)]">01</div>
              <div class="mt-2 font-semibold text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Plan</div>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
                Understand the laboratory, systems, interfaces, and objectives.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-b border-[var(--delvinta-border)] p-5 md:border-r">
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--delvinta-teal)]">02</div>
              <div class="mt-2 font-semibold text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Build</div>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
                Define interfaces, workflows, mappings, and technical requirements.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-b border-[var(--delvinta-border)] p-5 md:border-r">
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--delvinta-teal)]">03</div>
              <div class="mt-2 font-semibold text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Integrate</div>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
                Connect instruments, middleware, automation, and clinical systems.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-b border-[var(--delvinta-border)] p-5">
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--delvinta-teal)]">04</div>
              <div class="mt-2 font-semibold text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Test</div>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
                Validate connectivity, data flow, workflows, and expected results.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-b border-[var(--delvinta-border)] p-5 md:border-r">
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--delvinta-teal)]">05</div>
              <div class="mt-2 font-semibold text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Go-Live</div>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
                Coordinate deployment and transition into production operations.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-b border-[var(--delvinta-border)] p-5 md:border-r">
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--delvinta-teal)]">06</div>
              <div class="mt-2 font-semibold text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Stabilize</div>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
                Resolve issues, refine workflows, and establish operational stability.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-b border-[var(--delvinta-border)] p-5 md:border-r">
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--delvinta-teal)]">07</div>
              <div class="mt-2 font-semibold text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Support</div>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
                Provide technical support as the laboratory continues to evolve.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-5">
              <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--delvinta-teal)]">08</div>
              <div class="mt-2 font-semibold text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Optimize</div>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
                Improve efficiency, automation, monitoring, and long-term performance.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRINCIPLES -->
  <section class="delvinta-section bg-[var(--delvinta-light)]">
    <div class="delvinta-container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="delvinta-eyebrow">How We Work</div>

        <h2 class="delvinta-heading-small mt-4">Technical expertise grounded in the laboratory.</h2>

        <p class="delvinta-body mt-5">
          Integration is more than connecting systems. It requires understanding how technology, workflows, and people
          interact inside the laboratory.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="delvinta-card">
          <div class="delvinta-capability-tag">01</div>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Understand</h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
            We start with the laboratory workflow, existing environment, technical constraints, and desired outcome.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="delvinta-card">
          <div class="delvinta-capability-tag">02</div>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Integrate</h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
            We connect the systems and technologies required to move reliable laboratory data through the workflow.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="delvinta-card">
          <div class="delvinta-capability-tag">03</div>

          <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Improve</h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
            We look beyond go-live to identify opportunities for efficiency, automation, monitoring, and optimization.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ENGAGEMENT -->
  <section class="delvinta-section">
    <div class="delvinta-container">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-start lg:gap-20">
        <div>
          <div class="delvinta-eyebrow">Engagement</div>

          <h2 class="delvinta-heading-small mt-4">Support where the laboratory needs it.</h2>

          <p class="delvinta-body mt-5">
            DELVINTA can engage at a specific stage of a project or support the broader integration lifecycle.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="divide-y divide-[var(--delvinta-border)] border-y border-[var(--delvinta-border)]">
          <div class="grid gap-2 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-8">
            <div class="font-semibold text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Implementation</div>

            <div class="text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
              New laboratory environments, Epic Beaker implementations, and integration planning.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid gap-2 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-8">
            <div class="font-semibold text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Conversion</div>

            <div class="text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
              Instrument and interface conversions, migrations, testing, and production transition.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid gap-2 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-8">
            <div class="font-semibold text-[var(--delvinta-navy)]">Optimization</div>

            <div class="text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--delvinta-slate)]">
              Existing environments that need stabilization, support, automation, monitoring, or workflow improvement.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="delvinta-section border-t border-[var(--delvinta-border)]">
    <div class="delvinta-container">
      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-end">
        <div>
          <div class="delvinta-eyebrow">Let's Talk</div>

          <h2 class="delvinta-heading-small mt-4">Have a laboratory integration challenge?</h2>

          <p class="delvinta-body mt-5">Let's discuss where DELVINTA can help.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <a href="mailto:hello@delvinta.com" class="delvinta-button delvinta-button-primary"> Talk to DELVINTA </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
